    "body": "Fresh source combinations fail despite complete fitted28 answers. This four-read Rust diagnostic reproduces saved native actions on matched fitted/fresh source prefixes and proves the early keys stay exact while the suffix changes consumed query/controller features.\n\nThe ordering margin reverses from+74,696,431 to−1,602,081Q24: angular change helps+7,587,568, while radius compatibility harms−83,886,080. A separate prematureStop row gains52,122,830Q24 through latent/category terms. Saved178-position exposure shows previously observed cells explain most radial harm. Preserve alias multiplicity and token-versus-occurrence limits.\n\nNext: prospectively broader sequence learning comparing63 signed log-radius sharing with the current1024-cell control, common zero-radial native initialization and jointStop/Period. This is unrun, preserves all parents and adopts no reset/cursor/serving ablation. Expanded table cost remains unchanged.\n\nValidation:49 focused Rust tests and release pass; actual4reads2.768s, supervisor4.216s. Independent1,712 packed terms, native aliases/action replay, shared4/6keys, query trajectories,178saved context exposure and exact7-file return pass. No optimizer/GPU/generation campaign. References #1552.\n",
